            "options": {
                "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
                "content": "## Kiva Microfinance Executive Loan Analytics Dashboard\n\nThis executive dashboard provides strategic portfolio intelligence, loan disbursement metrics, and demographic capital allocation across micro-entrepreneur lending programs powered by ClickHouse OLAP and dbt transformations.\n\n#### Key Analytical Scopes:\n- **Portfolio Health & Capital Volume**: Live tracking of total capital disbursed, portfolio-wide funding fulfillment rate, and unique micro-entrepreneurs supported.\n- **Sectoral Exposure**: Breakdown of loan funding volume across key industries (Agriculture, Retail, Food, Services, etc.) to evaluate capital allocation.\n- **Geographical Footprint**: Country-level capital distribution identifying high-impact lending regions across East African corridors (Rwanda, Kenya, Uganda, etc.).*",
                "mode": "markdown"
            }
